# The address that gets paid. Put YOUR wallet address here — the one you want
# the coffee money to land in.
#
# There is deliberately NO default. The zero address is 40 valid hex characters,
# so a placeholder here would pass any shape check and arm the till against a
# burn address: on Arc, TokenMinterV2 burns to 0x0 constantly, and the till would
# announce a sale seconds after every request without anyone paying. Leave it
# empty and the app refuses to take a payment, which is the safe failure.
VITE_MERCHANT_ADDRESS=0xdE9A40f17aC209B4e65933d1C8703125EA35F3f1
